  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Beekeeping Value Chain Support</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of &lt;b&gt;the BEEKEEP project&lt;/b&gt; (Beekeeping Value Chain Support) is that the beekeeping industry is enhanced for inclusive growth, poverty reduction and food security in Tanzania. It&apos;s specific objective is to ensure that high quality honey produced in an environmentally sustainable manner leads to increased market penetration.     The project focuses on 3 main outputs: (1) Institutional capacity and enabling environment for beekeeping value chain actors is strengthened, while enhancing women&#x2019;s empowerment (Enabel-Led); (2) Capacities of beekeeping value chain actors improved and management of bee reserves and apiaries enhanced. (Enabel-Led) and (3) Market links and Trade of bee products strengthened (ITC-Led).</narrative>
  </description>
